    <name>Ring 4 from Kjelsås — Oslo Bike Tours</name>
    <desc>The classic Nordmarka gravel loop, starting and finishing at Kjelsås (end of tram line 11). 52 km, approx. 1080 m of climbing, waffle stop at Kikutstua. oslobiketours.no</desc>
